    <gov:hasDescription>Public food security card entitling beneficiary families to subsidized food grains and civil supplies under NFSA.</gov:hasDescription>
    <gov:hasApplicationProcedure>1. Visit state food &amp; civil supplies portal -&gt; 2. Apply for new Ration Card -&gt; 3. Provide Aadhaar IDs of all family members -&gt; 4. Submit income certificate -&gt; 5. Food Inspector inspects premises -&gt; 6. Card sanctioned.</gov:hasApplicationProcedure>
    <gov:officialPortalUrl>https://nfsa.gov.in</gov:officialPortalUrl>
    <gov:processingTime>20 to 30 Business Days</gov:processingTime>
    <gov:serviceFee>Rs 20 to Rs 50</gov:serviceFee>
