    <gov:hasApplicationProcedure>1. Visit state e-District portal -&gt; 2. Choose 'Revenue Services' -&gt; 'Income Certificate' -&gt; 3. Declare family income sources -&gt; 4. Upload salary slip or income affidavit -&gt; 5. Verification by VAO and Tehsildar -&gt; 6. Download digitally signed PDF.</gov:hasApplicationProcedure>
    <gov:officialPortalUrl>https://edistrict.gov.in</gov:officialPortalUrl>
