    <gov:hasApplicationProcedure>1. Log into e-District portal -&gt; 2. Select Caste/Community Certificate -&gt; 3. Provide paternal lineage community records -&gt; 4. Local Revenue Inspector enquiry -&gt; 5. Sub-Divisional Magistrate / Tehsildar signs credential.</gov:hasApplicationProcedure>
