    <gov:hasDescription>Transfer of vehicular ownership upon sale, purchase, or inheritance of two-wheelers and four-wheelers.</gov:hasDescription>
    <gov:hasApplicationProcedure>1. Log in to vahan.parivahan.gov.in -&gt; 2. Enter vehicle registration number -&gt; 3. Select 'Transfer of Ownership' -&gt; 4. Buyer and seller Aadhaar OTP consent -&gt; 5. Submit physical signed Form 29/30 to jurisdictional RTO.</gov:hasApplicationProcedure>
    <gov:officialPortalUrl>https://vahan.parivahan.gov.in</gov:officialPortalUrl>
    <gov:processingTime>15 to 30 Days</gov:processingTime>
    <gov:serviceFee>Rs 300 to Rs 500 depending on vehicle class</gov:serviceFee>
    <gov:hasSynonym>transfer rc of bike</gov:hasSynonym>
